{
  "mn26:0.1": "Middle Discourses 26 ",
  "mn26:0.2": "The Noble Quest ",
  "mn26:1.1": "So I have heard. ",
  "mn26:1.2": "At one time the Buddha was staying near Sāvatthī in Jeta’s Grove, Anāthapiṇḍika’s monastery. ",
  "mn26:2.1": "Then the Buddha robed up in the morning and, taking his bowl and robe, entered Sāvatthī for alms. ",
  "mn26:2.2": "Then several mendicants went up to Venerable Ānanda and said to him, ",
  "mn26:2.3": "“Reverend, it’s been a long time since we’ve heard a Dhamma talk from the Buddha. ",
  "mn26:2.4": "It would be good if we got to hear a Dhamma talk from the Buddha.” ",
  "mn26:2.5": "“Well then, reverends, go to the brahmin Rammaka’s hermitage. ",
  "mn26:2.6": "Hopefully you’ll get to hear a Dhamma talk from the Buddha.” ",
  "mn26:2.7": "“Yes, reverend,” they replied. ",
  "mn26:3.1": "Then, after the meal, on his return from almsround, the Buddha addressed Ānanda, ",
  "mn26:3.2": "“Come, Ānanda, let’s go to the stilt longhouse of Migāra’s mother in the Eastern Monastery for the day’s meditation.” ",
  "mn26:3.3": "“Yes, sir,” Ānanda replied. ",
  "mn26:3.4": "So the Buddha went with Ānanda to the Eastern Monastery for the day’s meditation. ",
  "mn26:3.5": "In the late afternoon the Buddha came out of retreat and addressed Ānanda, ",
  "mn26:3.6": "“Come, Ānanda, let’s go to the eastern gate to bathe.” ",
  "mn26:3.7": "“Yes, sir,” Ānanda replied. ",
  "mn26:3.8": "So the Buddha went with Ānanda to the east